cisely three  minutes which is the most ideal time for  brewing a black tea  you have the option of milk or sugar  it can be a full sit-down affair like  our full afternoon tea  you will have cakes you'll have your tea  your sandwiches and famously your scones  i think that the tradition of drinking  tea in england is one that's really  ingrained in our way of life it really  is  probably the one thing that absolutely  everybody has in common  drink tea on every occasion man because  there is no occasion for tea tea is the  occasion  [Music]  today is day two and i'm going to be  making moroccan tea i need green gum  powder tea some mint i'm using dried  mint and sugar  do not forget the sugar  traditionally in morocco tea service is  done by the male head of the house and  it's a tradition that is passed down  from father to son kind of interesting  [Music]  yeah that's sweet but it's really good  [Music]  [Music]  one  [Music]  foreign  [Music]  [Music]  today is day three and i'm going to be  drinking yerba mate which i have never  had ever uh mate is actually pretty  interesting because it has its own  vocabulary so you drink out of a cup  that is called a mate it is  traditionally a hollowed out gourd and  you drink with a straw that's called a  bombilla the bombilla has tiny holes at  the bottom that helps filter out the  yerba mate that is in your cup  okay i'm gonna try it  it's bitter definitely i would say a bit  of an acquired taste  i like drinking out of the straw that's  fun  i could get down with this today  [Music]  is  [Music]  [Music]  argentina  [Music]  [Music]  [Music]  [Music]  ah  [Music]  [Music]  okay  [Music]  today is day four and i'm drinking  russian style black tea what does that  mean it means i'm gonna be drinking  strong black tea fun fact about me i  actually used to live in russia so i  have intimate knowledge on how to make  this  this is the black tea concentrate you're  gonna add just a little bit on the  bottom  and then top it off with however much  water you want to dilute it  i don't know i guess i did half a cup i  do like a strong tea i'm not adding any  sugar to this one  oh it's hot  i burned my tongue but it's really good  [Music]  [Music]  [Music]  [Music]  foreign  [Music]  today is day five and i am drinking  japanese matcha not in a latte just  plain hot water no sugar  it's pretty high in caffeine so a little  goes a long way at least for me to make  matcha you use a whisk you can use any  whisk really but there is a matcha whisk  and you want to put it in a bowl and do  zigzag motions until you see little  bubbles form and then you know the  matcha is ready  it's nice actually matcha has a really  earthy taste and i like it  [Music]  a  [Music]  [Music]  [Music]  it is day six and i'm making a tea that  is close to my home and my heart masala  chai from india  so the first time that i learned to make  masala chai was when i went to india to  get married my mother-in-law taught me i  didn't really speak any hindi she didn't  really speak any english but we didn't  need language to communicate i don't  know it was just this really beautiful  moment something i'll never forget  oh this smells so good  yum  a common mistake that americans make is  they say chai tea chai is actually the  word for tea so it's like saying tea tea  yeah the more you know  [Music]  yeah yum this is really good my  mother-in-law would definitely be proud  we begin our day with having a cup of  chai  you put the chai on your burner the  first thing in the morning the whole  house wakes up and you get the smell all  over the house  my name is sunita banerjee  i live in mumbai india  the spices which you grind together our  ginger cardamom cinnamon  and if you like even a few peppercorns  to add a little bit of  watercolor make it a little more spicy  just grind it all together and add it to  your boiling water  add your tea leaves according to your  taste if you like it strong a little  more otherwise just one teaspoon per cup  approximately  let the whole concoction start boiling  add milk  and your tea is done  my father would say that the perfect cup  of tea when you have a sip of it it  should give you a taste of a biscuit  i think  tea has a very very important role to  play in every indians life  [Music]  today is the last day and i'm going to  be drinking taiwanese bubble tea i will  be making my own boba which i have here  and i have black tea that i was steeping  so this is a concentrate so that you can  still taste the tea flavor once i add  all of the milk and sugar there  definitely aren't that many health  benefits to bubble tea but if we're  talking about emotional benefits it  makes you feel amazing  so there's that  i mean  it looks pretty good  yum  i don't have the right straw so  i'm gonna use a spoon  yum bubble tea just makes you feel good  you know  [Music]  i wanna know  yeah  [Music]  [Music]  [Music]  [Music]  [Music]  here is what i've taken away from this  project  tea clearly can be a lot of different  things it can look different it can  taste different however the through line  that i have seen is that tea is not  actually about the tea itself it's  always nice to have a cup of tea and  relax however  it's about people and it's about  hospitality it's about togetherness  tea is something that in general is best  enjoyed with others  tea is hard for every reason to  socialize to be with friends  any time it's try time it's like a  social cement you can't go anywhere  without someone immediately offering you  a cup of tea  it is  [Music]  [Music]  my  [Music]  you

